# AdGuard's own runtime state. `work/` is the query log (417 MB with
# `querylog.interval: 90d`), the statistics database, the session database and
# the downloaded filter lists — all of it re-derivable and none of it reviewable
# in a diff.
work/

# The live configuration. AdGuard rewrites this file in full whenever anything
# changes in the web UI, as root mode 600, so tracking it would mean a working
# tree that is permanently dirty and unreadable without sudo — and it holds the
# admin bcrypt hash. AdGuardHome.seed.yaml is the tracked copy; see README.md.
config/
